questionText:
As a computing student, you are to program a robot to assist your colleagues to buy stationery from a shop. The sequence of activities undertaken to buy stationery at the shop is as follows:
Go to the stationery shop;
Check the price of the selected stationery;
Select the needed stationery;
Go to the cash counter;
Pay money to the cashier;
Take the stationery along;
Leave the shop.

Draw a flowchart using the sequence of activities.
